{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", "domain": "relationship", "question": "在2022壬寅年，以下哪项是命主的婚姻经历？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，身弱喜火土。命局中月柱甲木正官透出，日支巳火为夫宫，但巳火被申金合绊，且时柱壬申金水旺，官星甲木坐申金受克，婚姻宫不稳，易有感情波折。\n\n2022年壬寅，流年天干壬水为正财，地支寅木为正官，寅申冲，且寅巳申三刑，夫宫与官星均受冲刑，主婚姻宫动荡，夫妻关系紧张。命局中甲木正官为夫星，但被申金所克，暗示丈夫在命主生活中存在压力或疏离。流年寅木引动申金冲刑，且寅巳申三刑俱全，主刑伤、分离之象。\n\n结合选项，命主自身八字官星受克，且流年冲刑夫宫，更可能是命主自身婚姻出现问题，而非丈夫外遇。且三刑主刑伤，若为外遇被发现，难以得到原谅，易导致离婚。因此，最符合的是B选项：命主之前已有外遇，2022年被丈夫发现，得不到丈夫原谅，当年搞离婚。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "4ff52ed3b21199cf678546fc773e3033b509c7ff6b757789a0e8de75ce2fb0f4", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q5", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3754, "response_id": "9a578870-c335-4e73-8d47-306040b9b66c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 534, "completion_tokens": 279, "total_tokens": 813, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 22}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
