{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q11", "domain": "unknown", "question": "大约哪个时间段，运程最佳？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为丁火，生于寒冬子月，地支丑、酉、子、丑，金水旺盛，火气衰弱，日主身弱无疑。命局喜木火为用神，忌金水。\n\n大运排布中：\n- 23—32岁对应丁酉大运（1988-1997），丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为忌，且与原局酉金伏吟，金旺克木，火势仍弱，运程平平。\n- 33—42岁对应丙申大运（1998-2007），丙火劫财帮身，但申金合子水，水势更旺，且申酉戌会金局，忌神金水猖獗，此运压力大，运程不佳。\n- 43—52岁对应乙未大运（2008-2017），乙木偏印生火，未土为燥土，且未中藏丁火，能暖局助火，木火相生，忌神金水受制，此运明显好转，为最佳时期。\n- 53—62岁对应甲午大运（2018-2027），甲木正印生火，午火为日主强根，木火通明，但午火与子水相冲，冲则动，虽吉但波动较大，且午酉相破，金火交战，不如乙未运纯粹顺畅。\n\n综合比较，43—52岁乙未大运，木火相生，燥土制水，是命主一生中运程最佳阶段。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q11", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4397, "response_id": "54eb49b2-72a2-4e5f-8691-68d7b9d5cea2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 408, "completion_tokens": 349, "total_tokens": 757, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 24}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q12", "domain": "relationship", "question": "何时结婚？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，需木火帮扶。年柱、时柱辛丑金土耗火，月柱庚子金水更增寒湿。日支酉金为偏财，但丁火坐偏财，财星旺而身弱，婚姻宫坐偏财，暗示配偶可能带来压力或需付出较多。\n\n大运方面，早年己亥、戊戌运（7-26岁）土水混杂，感情难稳定。27岁起进入丁酉、丙申运（27-46岁），比劫帮身，但地支金旺，财星过重，感情机会虽有，但易因现实因素（如经济、家庭）而波折。47岁后乙未、甲午运（47-66岁），木火印比生扶日主，身渐强，此时婚姻宫酉金受午火冲（甲午运），有动婚之象，但已属中年后期。\n\n综合来看，命局身弱财旺，早年感情难成，中年后运势转好，但婚姻宫逢冲，且时柱偏财透干，可能晚婚或婚姻较迟。选项中，43-52岁（即2004-2013年）正值乙未、甲午运初，木火助身，且甲午运冲婚姻宫，有婚动可能，但更符合“晚婚”特征。而33-42岁（丙申运）虽比劫帮身，但申金合酉，财星更旺，压力大，不易成婚。因此最可能为43-52岁。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q12", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5238, "response_id": "8856b9e4-27f7-45e8-ab10-e13475fad3a2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 401, "completion_tokens": 355, "total_tokens": 756, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 17}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_19611230_P003-Q13", "domain": "career", "question": "有官非刑事出现的时间？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于子月，水旺火弱，全局金水气势强盛，丁火身弱无疑。年柱、时柱均为辛丑，月柱庚子，金水成势，官杀（水）与财星（金）混杂，日支酉金为偏财，形成财生杀、杀攻身的格局。这种组合在命理上容易因财或人际关系引发官非。\n\n大运方面，命主7岁起运，依次为：\n- 己亥（7-16岁）、戊戌（17-26岁）、丁酉（27-36岁）、丙申（37-46岁）、乙未（47-56岁）等。\n\n问题问“有官非刑事出现的时间”，需看大运与流年引动官杀（水）或刑冲合害。\n\n- 13-22岁（约1974-1983年）行戊戌大运，戊土伤官制杀，但原局水旺，伤官制杀不力，且戊土为燥土，与命局金水相战，易有口舌是非，但刑事官非可能性较低。\n- 23-32岁（约1984-1993年）行丁酉大运，丁火比肩帮身，但酉金为财，财生杀，且酉酉自刑（日支酉与大运酉），刑动夫妻宫，易因财或家庭纠纷引发官非，但比肩帮身尚可，刑事程度有限。\n- 33-42岁（约1994-2003年）行丙申大运，丙火劫财帮身，但申金为财，申子半合水局，官杀更旺，财生杀攻身，此运官杀极旺，且丙火被申金耗，身弱难抗，最易引发刑事官非。流年如1996丙子、1997丁丑等，水旺加重，风险极高。\n- 43-53岁（约2004-2013年）行乙未大运，乙木偏印生身，未土为食神制杀，但未土与命局丑土相冲，冲开墓库，也可能引发官非，但印星化杀，程度较轻。\n\n综合判断，33-42岁丙申大运，财杀攻身最烈，且申子半合水局，官杀无制，是刑事官非最可能出现的时期。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITHOUT_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "ccc35a892bd55a08dff4f46f8cfe7aae61028304110bfee39e4cdf0455e6f904", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19611230_P003-Q13", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6413, "response_id": "dfe8a8be-910d-4b90-bfff-ec90b65a5854", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 407, "completion_tokens": 542, "total_tokens": 949, "prompt_tokens_details": {"